{"server":"jp","storyId":"act17d0_level_act17d0_06_end","groupId":"act17d0","stageId":"act17d0_06","title":"領主邸攻防戦","storyCode":"OD-6","avgTag":"戦闘後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/activities/act17d0/level_act17d0_06_end.txt","sourceHash":"719a50e9eb488cf174c4b25bbf0180f439886e185d9dba4227e13347c786da98","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"ロングスプリング領主の長男が権力の強奪を企み、傭兵と変異生物に領主への襲撃を命じた。領主の衛兵隊は襲撃の中で全滅してしまい、ロドスはレインボー小隊と協力し反乱軍と交戦した。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_nobleN"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blitz","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"クリア！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"よし、警戒は任せた！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"アレクサンドル、倒れてる傭兵の中に、まだ生きてる人が紛れていないか確認して！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"了解、"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"ティナ、包帯を用意して。人数の確認後、負傷者の手当てをする。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"わかった！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"死んだふりをするな！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"ま、待て！　じゅ……銃口をどけてくれ！　何でも話す！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"ケッツ、そいつを縛り上げておけ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blitz","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"わかった。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"先生は？　ミアロ先生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"シュヴァルツ","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"こちらです！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ミアロ","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……ゴホッ……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"ティナ！　包帯を！　早く！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"起きろ！　先生！　目を閉じるなよ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"どうして……何が起こったの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無理にアーツを使って……源石の感染が広がったんです……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"ロドスで治療はできないの？　あんたたちの本業でしょ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"失血、重篤な熱傷、鉱石病の激しい発作……たとえロドス本艦にいたとしても、これは……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ミアロ","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……ゴホッ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"持ちこたえろ、先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ミアロ","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"……遠い異国へ旅したいんじゃなかったのか？　夢にまで見たクルビアを想像するんだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"……持ちこたえろ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ミアロ","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"ゴホッゴホッ……ゴホッ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ミアロ","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……ゴホッ……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"先生……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"……彼はもう……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"シュヴァルツ","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"申し訳ありません、私が……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"違う……あんたのせいじゃない。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"……違う……俺とは関係ない！　俺じゃない！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"*ロシア語スラング*、ぶっ殺す。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"……俺はただ……やめろ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"終わりだ！　*ロシア語スラング*、死ね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"やめろ！　やめてくれ！　俺じゃない！！　やめろ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blitz","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"アレクサンドル！　やめろ！　冷静になれ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"あの衛兵隊長はどこへ行ったんですか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"シュヴァルツ","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"逃げた相手を追いかけて行きました。レンジャーさんも同行しています。ご安心を。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"あれは……！　先生の体の結晶が……光ってる？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘘でしょ！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"こんなに早く？　どうして！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"シュヴァルツ","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"皆さん、手分けして密閉できる部屋を探してください！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"何をする気？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"説明は後！　急いで！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布を持ってきてください！　カーテンとかシーツとか……大きな布なら何でも構いません！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"シュヴァルツ","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"先生をあちらの小部屋に！　早く！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"何が起きたんだ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"先生がどうしたの？　どうして……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"コ、コーエンさん、ひとまず落ち着いてください。今、フランカが処理を――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"処理？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"何を処理してるの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"見たことないんですか？　ですが説明は後です、今は――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"扉も窓も閉めて！　隙間も全部塞いで！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"シュヴァルツ","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"煙突！　煙突も塞いでください！　通気口もです！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"これは……これは何事なの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blitz","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"わからない。先生の遺体に……何か問題でもあるのか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"行くな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"どうして？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"行くな……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"シュヴァルツ","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"上は全て塞ぎました！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"扉も窓も塞いだわ！　よし……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"待って！　部屋の中が光った？　扉や窓が光ってる？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"コーエンさん！　近付かないでください！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"見ないであげてください……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"一体、何が起きてるの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"先生は……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac17_8"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ash","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"あっ……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_456_ash","aliases":["Ash"]},{"speakerId":"char_457_blitz","aliases":["Blitz"]},{"speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","aliases":["Frost"]},{"speakerId":"char_459_tachak","aliases":["Tachanka"]}]}
